    "status": "PASS",
    "source": "Same quantity on both sides: done and the distinct edge and vertex counts of the section between the centred 10 mm cube and the 10 mm cube at (5,5,5), fuzzy 0.001. The cubes meet at one corner, so the section is a single vertex and no edge; the test asserts only that the result is non-nil. Bridge: Shape.section(with:tolerance:) non-nil (OCCTBooleanSectionWithTolerance) and subShapes(ofType: .edge/.vertex).count. Kernel: BRepAlgoAPI_Section with SetFuzzyValue(0.001) and Build, IsDone, TopExp::MapShapes edge and vertex counts; sectionWithTolerance line of the transcript.",
    "probe": "Scripts/repro/766-modeling-boolean-expansion/probe-evidence-fix.mm (transcript-evidence-fix.txt)"
  },
